  "notes": "Year = year of birth. Lists taken from SSA's own 'Popular Names by Birth Year' tool (form on the source page, posting to https://www.ssa.gov/cgi-bin/popularnames.cgi) with Top 100 selected for birth years 2025 and 2024; the tool can list up to the top 1000, only the top 100 per sex is stored here. Per SSA, names are from Social Security card applications for births that occurred in the United States; rank 1 is the most popular. Where two names have the same count (e.g. girls Ellie/Lucy in 2025) the order is the one SSA shows. The 2025 top 10 was cross-checked against the 'Top 10 Baby Names of 2025' table on the SSA home page. SSA spells names without diacritics (e.g. 'Jose', 'Sofia', 'Lucia')."
